@startuml class-state-pattern
title State pattern - Vòng đời đơn hàng
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

class Order {
  - status : OrderStatus
  + pickUp()
  + deliverSuccess(amount)
  + deliverFail(reason)
  + ...()
  ~ moveTo(next)
}
note right of Order
  pickUp() { status.getState().pickUp(this); }
  Order không chứa if/switch theo trạng thái.
end note

enum OrderStatus {
  + getState() : OrderState
}

interface OrderState {
  + allowedActions(order) : Set<OrderAction>
  + assignShipper(order, shipper)
  + cancel(order)
  + pickUp(order)
  + deliverSuccess(order, amount)
  + deliverFail(order, reason)
  + retryDelivery(order, shipper)
  + startReturn(order)
  + confirmReturned(order)
}

abstract class AbstractOrderState {
  # reject(order, action)
  # requireActiveShipper(shipper)
}
note bottom of AbstractOrderState
  Mặc định mọi thao tác đều ném BusinessException.
  Lớp con chỉ ghi đè thao tác hợp lệ ở trạng thái đó.
end note

class WaitingAssignmentState
class WaitingPickupState
class DeliveringState
class FailedDeliveryState
class ReturningState
class FinalState

Order --> OrderStatus
OrderStatus --> OrderState
OrderState <|.. AbstractOrderState
AbstractOrderState <|-- WaitingAssignmentState
AbstractOrderState <|-- WaitingPickupState
AbstractOrderState <|-- DeliveringState
AbstractOrderState <|-- FailedDeliveryState
AbstractOrderState <|-- ReturningState
AbstractOrderState <|-- FinalState
@enduml
